# app/Dockerfile.test builds this context (compose `app-test` and `app-ts`),
# which is the repo root. app/Dockerfile has its own allowlist
# (app/Dockerfile.dockerignore), which BuildKit prefers for that Dockerfile.
# The Go v1 image this file was written for is gone (T7.1).
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
reference
deploy
*.md
!docs/admin-guide.md
unitmaterial
docs/movin-v2
tmp
app/node_modules
